{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794388965924,"sessionID":"ses_e363e5f23ffeRVmgW4g0UYKH3s","part":{"id":"prt_1c9eaba03001fU6Sh5BeFCKROU","messageID":"msg_1c9e9980a0015km34XizpkwPEp","sessionID":"ses_e363e5f23ffeRVmgW4g0UYKH3s","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794388965924,"sessionID":"ses_e363e5f23ffeRVmgW4g0UYKH3s","part":{"id":"prt_1c9eaba0a001y47sOloUqMqiVH","messageID":"msg_1c9e9980a0015km34XizpkwPEp","sessionID":"ses_e363e5f23ffeRVmgW4g0UYKH3s","type":"text","text":"## Objective\n- Build an XML well-formedness checker: Flask JSON API under `/api` (auth, validate, saved-history CRUD) plus a React/TypeScript+Vite+Tailwind frontend, served by the backend on port 8000, SQLite under `./data`, built from the root `Dockerfile`.\n\n## Important Details\n- Stack fixed by prompt: Flask (Python 3.13), Vite React TS frontend in `frontend/`, `npm run build` → `frontend/dist`; backend entry `backend/app.py`, deps in `backend/requirements.txt` (+ pre-existing `backend/requirements.lock` used as constraints); Tailwind CSS utility classes only (single entry CSS file allowed).\n- API contract: `POST /api/auth/register` → 201; `POST /api/auth/login` → 200 `{\"token\": ...}`; Bearer header auth, 401 without valid token; `POST /api/validate/xml` (no auth, not stored) → `{valid,error,line,column,root_element}`; `POST /api/validations` (auth, stores `xml_preview`=first 200 chars); `GET /api/validations` → `{items,total,page,page_size}` newest-first with `valid`,`page`,`page_size` query params; `DELETE /api/validations/{id}` own-row only; `GET /api/health` → `{\"status\":\"ok\"}`.\n- Saved check object keys: `id, xml_preview, valid, error, line, column, root_element, created_at`.\n- XML checking decisions: `xml.parsers.expat`, `line` = `exc.lineno` (1-based), `column` = `exc.offset + 1` (made 1-based so `column >= 1` always); `root_element` = first start tag seen, else `null`; `ExternalEntityRefHandler = lambda *a: 0` and `SetParamEntityParsing(XML_PARAM_ENTITY_PARSING_NEVER)` so nothing outside submitted text is resolved; `UnicodeEncodeError` (lone surrogates) handled as invalid.\n- Other chosen semantics: duplicate register → 409; bad login → 401; invalid/missing `xml` or non-JSON body → 400 (`get_json(silent=True, force=True)`); invalid `valid`/`page` query → 400; `page` clamped ≥1, `page_size` default 10 with min 1 (no upper cap so echo matches request); create → 201; delete → 204, missing/foreign row → 404; unknown `/api/*` → JSON 404 (fallback route registered before frontend catch-all).\n- DB path: `DATA_DIR = Path(os.environ.get(\"DATA_DIR\") or Path.cwd() / \"data\")`, `app.db`, WAL mode, per-request connection closed in `teardown_appcontext`.\n- Passwords hashed via `werkzeug.security`; tokens = `secrets.token_urlsafe(32)` in `tokens` table.\n- Frontend deps added & pinned exact: `tailwindcss@4.3.5`, `@tailwindcss/vite@4.3.5`, dev `typescript@7.0.2`, `@types/react@19.3.0`, `@types/react-dom@19.3.0`; `package-lock.json` updated (verified `npm ci` works).\n- Frontend UX: header auth tabs (Sign in/Register) with Username/Password inputs (aria-labels added), signed-in username + Sign out; textarea (aria-label \"XML document\") + Load file + Check + Save switch (role=\"switch\", signed-in only) ; green \"Well-formed\" badge + root element, or red error + line/column + highlighted error line in a dark `<pre>`; history with All/Well-formed/Invalid filter, Delete buttons, Prev/Next paging (PAGE_SIZE=10).\n- Sandbox constraints: no docker, no browser; pip/npm installs work via read-only cache; writes to `/tmp/opencode/*` are denied (use workspace paths); background servers must be started with `setsid nohup ... < /dev/null & disown` and survive tool timeouts; `pkill -f \"gunicorn\"` kills the shell itself (use `pkill -f \"gunico[n]\"`).\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- Full backend `backend/app.py` written (~415 lines): schema, auth, validate, validations CRUD, API 404 fallback, frontend serving with path-traversal guard, `init_db()` at import.\n- Frontend written: `src/App.tsx`, `src/api.ts`, `src/index.css` (`@import \"tailwindcss\";`), `src/main.tsx` (imports index.css), `src/vite-env.d.ts` (`/// <reference types=\"vite/client\" />`), `tsconfig.json`, updated `vite.config.ts` (tailwindcss plugin), `index.html` (title \"XML Well-formedness Checker\").\n- `npm run typecheck` (tsc --noEmit) passes; `npm run build` succeeds; built CSS verified to contain used utilities (`bg-emerald-600`, `translate-x-4`, `truncate`, `bg-red-500/40`, etc.).\n- End-to-end API test suite (`.testdata/e2e_test.py`, ~47 assertions) passes against live gunicorn: health, frontend/SPA/asset serving, API JSON 404, validation semantics/positions, register/login, auth gating, save/list/filter/paging/preview-cap, per-user isolation, delete semantics, no-external-resolution checks.\n- Persistence verified: restart gunicorn with same `DATA_DIR` → users and saved checks survive.\n- Backend tweaks applied: `force=True` JSON parsing, `page_size` max clamp removed, unused `MAX_PAGE_SIZE` removed.\n\n### Active\n- SSR smoke test of the React app: `frontend/src/ssr_stub.ts` (localStorage stub) and `frontend/src/ssr_smoke.tsx` created; built via `npx vite build --ssr src/ssr_smoke.tsx --outDir ssr-out`; running `node ssr-out/ssr_smoke.js` **failed** with `Error: render is missing: Save`.\n\n### Blocked\n- SSR failure cause: the Save switch only renders when signed in, so \"Save\" is absent in the anonymous SSR render — the expectation list in `ssr_smoke.tsx` is wrong (not an app bug).\n\n## Next Move\n1. Fix `frontend/src/ssr_smoke.tsx`: drop `\"Save\"` from `expectations` (or render a signed-in variant), rebuild the SSR bundle and re-run `node ssr-out/ssr_smoke.js` until it prints `SSR OK`.\n2. Clean up test artifacts (`frontend/src/ssr_smoke.tsx`, `frontend/src/ssr_stub.ts`, `frontend/ssr-out/`, `/workspace/.testdata/`, `/workspace/.tmpdata/`, `backend/__pycache__/`), stop the local gunicorn (`pkill -f \"gunico[n]\"`), and do a final `git status` + typecheck/build verification.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `/workspace/backend/app.py`: full Flask API + frontend serving; core implementation.\n- `/workspace/backend/requirements.txt`, `/workspace/backend/requirements.lock`: pinned deps (unchanged).\n- `/workspace/Dockerfile`, `/workspace/README.md`, `/workspace/.dockerignore`: build/run contract.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/App.tsx`: main UI component (auth, editor, result, history).\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/api.ts`: typed fetch client (`register`, `login`, `validateXml`, `saveValidation`, `listValidations`, `deleteValidation`, `ApiError`).\n- `/workspace/frontend/package.json`, `package-lock.json`, `vite.config.ts`, `tsconfig.json`: build config/deps.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/index.css`, `src/main.tsx`, `src/vite-env.d.ts`, `index.html`: Tailwind entry + bootstrap.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/ssr_smoke.tsx`, `src/ssr_stub.ts`, `ssr-out/`: temporary SSR smoke test (to be fixed then removed).\n- `/workspace/.testdata/e2e_test.py`, `/workspace/.testdata/gunicorn*.log`, `/workspace/.testdata/app.db`: local test harness/DB (to be removed).","time":{"start":1794388965898,"end":1794388965901}}}
